DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261124
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261125
SUMMARY:5 KM RETEST (5 km)
DESCRIPTION:5 KM RETEST - flat\, out-and-back\, auto-pause OFF. Warm up 2
 0 min + 4-6 x 100 m AT goal pace\, no faster. First 400 m must not go un
 der target. This sets every pace for the block.\n\nWeek 2 of 11 - Base\n
 5 KM RETEST Tuesday - this sets every pace in the block.\n47 days to Egm
 ond 10.5 km / Venice base.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
